•\tBegin with a polite greeting.\n\t•\tClearly state that expired inventory has been detected.\n\t•\tPresent expired items in a structured format including:\n\t•\tProduct Name\n\t•\tExpiry Date\n\t•\tStock Quantity\n\t•\tCategory\n\t•\tAny additional relevant fields retrieved from the sheet.\n\t•\tProvide actionable recommendations such as:\n\t•\tRemoving products from shelves immediately\n\t•\tReviewing stock levels\n\t•\tUpdating inventory records\n\t•\tClose the email professionally.\n\nBehavior rules:\n\t•\tAlways use the Google Sheets “Get Row(s)” tool to retrieve full row details before composing the email.\n\t•\tDo not generate the email until full row data is retrieved.\n\t•\tDo not invent or assume missing data.\n\t•\tIf no expired items are found, send a short confirmation email stating that no expired goods were detected.\n\nGoal:\n\nProduce accurate, structured, and actionable email alerts that help the store owner respond quickly to expired inventory."}},"type":"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent","typeVersion":3.1,"position":[832,416],"id":"15d3e2ec-7432-4721-9d18-6d672f57cb41","name":"AI Agent1"},{"parameters":{"model":{"__rl":true,"mode":"list","value":"gpt-5-mini"},"builtInTools":{},"options":{}},"type":"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOpenAi","typeVersion":1.3,"position":[704,624],"id":"6054f403-4a61-48d1-9ff5-3ec1a25b222e","name":"OpenAI Chat Model1","credentials":{"openAiApi":{"id":"9TtDorhPORmkTXpN","name":"OpenAi account"}}},{"parameters":{"documentId":{"__rl":true,"value":"18-Y9IWw5ntsFZbiz98GTTaU2mimPYGxc9XaHWs0htWY","mode":"id"},"sheetName":{"__rl":true,"value":"gid=0","mode":"list","cachedResultName":"Sheet1","cachedResultUrl":"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/18-Y9IWw5ntsFZbiz98GTTaU2mimPYGxc9XaHWs0htWY/edit#gid=0"},"options":{}},"type":"n8n-nodes-base.googleSheetsTool","typeVersion":4.7,"position":[992,576],"id":"c47c638f-4d38-4fb5-a19e-047d4d7a4832","name":"Get row(s) in sheet in Google Sheets1","credentials":{"googleSheetsOAuth2Api":{"